### [1] Create Lab Result
POST http://localhost:8081/api/lab-results
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "labOrderId": "2a6e00e8-0b96-4cb9-b733-fa57972e757e",
  "patientId": "8e2416d9-dd07-471a-b1ca-fabd3b5b5a60",
  "resultValue": "103",
  "resultUnit": "mg/dL",
  "resultDate": "2025-07-27T13:00:00",
  "notes": "First glucose reading by lab scientist",
  "assignmentId": "a9c37387-fdf4-4395-ba14-0e1c2fe8f169"
}


###

### [2] Get Lab Result by ID
GET http://localhost:8081/api/lab-results/c4f553c9-5dfd-41f6-af4e-cdc578afac23
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### [3] List All Lab Results
GET http://localhost:8081/api/lab-results
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### [4] Update Lab Result
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/lab-results/c4f553c9-5dfd-41f6-af4e-cdc578afac23
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "labOrderId": "2a6e00e8-0b96-4cb9-b733-fa57972e757e",
  "resultValue": "97",
  "resultUnit": "mg/dL",
  "resultDate": "2025-07-27T13:00:00",
  "notes": "Updated after retest",
  "assignmentId": "a9c37387-fdf4-4395-ba14-0e1c2fe8f169"
}

###

### [5] Delete Lab Result
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/lab-results/{{labResultId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### [6] Get Lab Results by Lab Order ID
GET http://localhost:8081/api/lab-results?labOrderId=5881770-6e7c-47e7-8ba2-03895c688cdd
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### [7] Get Lab Results by Patient ID
GET http://localhost:8081/api/lab-results?patientId=REPLACE_WITH_PATIENT_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
